7. Component Responsibilities (summary)
DiscoveryManager: orchestrates platform discovery adapters and exposes “NearbyDevice” events.
HandshakeManager: initiates and validates key exchange; enforces one unsolicited message policy.
SessionManager: maintains live crypto session and ratchet state; rotates session keys as needed.
TransportAdapter: abstracts BLE / Wi-Fi / Multipeer transports and manages chunking/reassembly.
EphemeralStore: encrypted DB with TTL purging and friend token storage.
AbuseManager: local blocking, rate limiting, reporting queue to backend.
SyncManager / ApiClient: opt-in cloud interactions for friend token syncing, push registration, and abuse analytics.

